<div class="kdm-body"><fieldset {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}><header class="kdm-header"><p class="kdm-eyebrow">Kingdom Death: Monster · Item</p><label>Name<input name="name" value="{{item.name}}" required></label></header><label>Source (private reference)<input name="system.source" value="{{system.source}}"></label><label>Keywords (free text)<input name="system.keywords" value="{{system.keywords}}"></label>{{#if isResource}}<label>Quantity<input type="number" name="system.quantity" value="{{system.quantity}}" step="1" min="0"></label>{{/if}}{{#if isGear}}<h2>Attack profile · manual reference</h2><p>Zero values mean not configured. No attack rolls are implemented.</p><div class="kdm-stats"><label>Speed<input type="number" name="system.attack.speed" value="{{system.attack.speed}}" step="1" min="0"></label><label>Accuracy target<input type="number" name="system.attack.accuracy" value="{{system.attack.accuracy}}" step="1" min="0"></label><label>Strength<input type="number" name="system.attack.strength" value="{{system.attack.strength}}" step="1"></label></div><h2>Edge affinities</h2><p>Stored for future adjacency calculations; no rotation or automatic bonuses.</p><div class="kdm-stats">{{#each sides}}<label>{{side}}<select name="system.affinities.{{side}}">{{#each colors}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{value}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}<label class="kdm-notes">Game notes (visible to document viewers)<textarea name="system.notes" rows="4">{{system.notes}}</textarea></label></fieldset>{{#if editable}}<footer><button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save changes</button></footer>{{else}}<p>Read-only. Ask the GM for ownership to edit.</p>{{/if}}</div>